        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::You observe a Praetorian enforcer struggling to operate a small electronic device. He's somewhat frantically trying to make the device work, but all his efforts are futile and it's making him more nervous by the minute. From time to time, he lifts up his head while he's coming up with new ideas as to what to do next. The enforcer next to him seems to be completely absent from the matter. :: &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
