        <source>Senior Enforcer? Can't be. ::He scratches his head by lifting up his right shoulder, firmly holding the device in his hands.:: &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q26" name="=&gt;q26">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">52</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The enforcer takes a hard look at you for a moment.:: Ah yes, I recognize you. I've seen you around the HQ. Disembark on the back of the ship, then come over to us here.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a27" name="=&gt;a27">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">54</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>On my way.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a28" name="=&gt;a28">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">56</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm a fellow Praetorian, It's my duty to help my colleagues in need.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a29" name="=&gt;a29">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">58</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>As an agent of Coretech, here I see a device I could easily repair.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q30" name="=&gt;q30">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">60</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Coretech? ::The enforcer gives his best effort to finally fix the device but to no result. He proceeds to lower the device down.:: Ugh, I don't think I have much choice here. ::He glances at the nearby enforcer for a short moment.:: Fine, whatever, I hope you know what you are doing. Come over to us from the back of the ship.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a31" name="=&gt;a31">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">62</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'll hop right on.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a32" name="=&gt;a32">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">64</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I like to help out people I meet.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q33" name="=&gt;q33">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">66</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::After a short period, the enforcer stops tinkering with his device.:: People you meet? ::He looks around himself.:: Ah, at this point I don't even care. Come over from the back of the ship. If I don't get this thing to work, I'll be in some serious trouble. ::He raises his hand and points to the west.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a34" name="=&gt;a34">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">68</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'll be right there in a moment.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a35" name="=&gt;a35">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">70</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Yeah, I dont know either. ::Leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a36" name="=&gt;a36">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">72</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Come to think of it, I'll just mind my own business.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q37" name="=&gt;q37">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">74</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The enforcer ignores you and continues to tinker about his device.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
