      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a39" name="=&gt;a39">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">78</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Just wanted to hear your last words! ::Attack!::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a40" name="=&gt;a40">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">80</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Greetings fellow soldiers, I'm Enforcer $(context.player.Name). Need a hand?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q41" name="=&gt;q41">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">82</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::After registering what you've just said, the guard stops tinkering with his device.:: What are you doing out here? Did someone order reinforcements? I only hope you have some skills in electronics or otherwise we're all doomed here.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a42" name="=&gt;a42">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">84</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>And why is that?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q43" name="=&gt;q43">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">86</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The enforcer leans towards you and starts whispering.:: The guy over there, which we've been assigned to safeguard, is getting aggravated by the moment. You see, he has ordered us to repair this device for him or else, he'll report back to our superiors. He'll tell them how we are incapable of handling most basic of guard duties. Our pay will be cut by a lot if we fail to fulfill his needs. We might even face suspension from work.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a44" name="=&gt;a44">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">88</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Let me in, I'll fix the device for you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q45" name="=&gt;q45">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">90</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Okay. ::He points to the west:: Land on the back of the ship and come over to me.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a46" name="=&gt;a46">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">92</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Will do.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a47" name="=&gt;a47">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">94</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Nod.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a48" name="=&gt;a48">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">96</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Uhh, yeah. I'll just pass in that case. I don't want my reputation to be ruined.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a49" name="=&gt;a49">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">98</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>With myself here, there is nothing to be scared of.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q50" name="=&gt;q50">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">100</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I only hope you've got some decent electronics skills.

&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a51" name="=&gt;a51">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">102</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Greetings soldiers, I'm Senior Enforcer $(context.player.Name). Need assistance?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a52" name="=&gt;a52">
