        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">168</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::As they hear those words, both enforcers freeze for a short moment. Suddenly they turn around towards you and one of them yells.:: We are being raided, move to your positions!&lt;end&gt;</source>
