        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">204</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::After taking the device from the enforcer, you notice that it is custom made as it has a name printed on it: "Matriuss Ludenlof." The plastic casing on it considerably worn out. The back of the device is much more damaged, exposing the electronics.::

&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q103" name="=&gt;q103">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">206</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
