        <source>::After some tinkering you try your best to fix the device. However, your skills in electronics are not enough to figure out the root cause of its malfunction. You hand back over the device.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q104" name="=&gt;q104">
