        <source>::The enforcer reels back as he sees that you weren't successful. However, he's not that unhappy about it.:: Oh well, you gave your best. The owner of the device, Mr. Matriuss, would probably still want to talk to you. He has earlier expressed his need for someone to go back to shore in order to do something for him.&lt;end&gt;</source>
